  "readmes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "repoId": 142,
      "content": "# Cloud Infrastructure\n\nInfrastructure as code templates for AWS, Azure, and GCP.\nThis project provides production-ready Terraform and scripting templates designed to simplify cloud deployment and management.\n\n## Features\n- Modular Terraform architecture\n- Multi-cloud support (AWS, Azure, GCP)\n- Secure IAM and networking templates\n- CI/CD-ready structure\n\n## Use Cases\n- Rapid cloud environment setup\n- Standardized infrastructure across teams\n- Best-practice cloud security implementation"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "repoId": 200,
      "content": "# EmergencyApp\n\nEmergencyApp is a smart emergency communication system with AI-powered first aid guidance.\nThe app enables users to quickly contact emergency services and share critical medical and location information.\n\n## Core Features\n- One-tap emergency calling\n- Voice-activated emergency trigger\n- Real-time location sharing\n- AI-based first aid instructions\n- Smartwatch vital sign monitoring\n\n## Target Users\n- Individuals\n- Elderly users\n- People with chronic conditions"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "repoId": 3,
      "content": "# DiabetesDietAI\n\nDiabetesDietAI is an AI-driven system that provides personalized meal recommendations for diabetes management.\nIt analyzes user food intake, blood sugar levels, and preferences to suggest healthier meal options.\n\n## Key Capabilities\n- Personalized meal planning\n- Blood sugar–aware recommendations\n- Regional food database\n- AI-based decision logic\n\n## Goal\nHelp users maintain stable blood glucose levels through smarter nutrition choices."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "repoId": 4,
      "content": "# ProgrammingClubProjects\n\nThis repository contains a collection of projects developed during Programming Club courses.\nIt serves as a portfolio showcase and learning reference for club members.\n\n## Included Projects\n- Web development projects\n- React and JavaScript applications\n- UI/UX practice projects\n- Team-based course assignments\n\n## Purpose\n- Encourage collaborative learning\n- Showcase student achievements\n- Provide reusable learning resources"
    }
  ],
